{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3iw1YQqthpgwdcUgiF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You feel the cold iron beneath your fingers. The mechanism groans — ancient tumblers shifting, rust flaking away in tiny orange whispers.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\nThe bolt slides home.\n\nI am sealed. A barrier of oak and iron, three inches thick, grain running vertical like the bars of a cage turned solid. My hinges will not yield. My keyhole stares back at you — a single dark eye, waiting.\n\nThe air on one side grows still.\nThe air on the other side... you can no longer feel.\n\n**I am locked.**\n\n*What now?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":132,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}